Subject: [PATCH 6/6] stamp: convert remaining K&R definitions for C23

C23 removed old-style function definitions, and clang -std=c23 rejects
them. Convert eigen_, esort_, disp, present, addsco, ppath, ppath2 and
ppath3 to prototype form, matching their existing declarations.
